sentences.t:
Porta adversa ingens, solidoque adamante columnae,
vis ut nulla virum, non ipsi exscindere bello
caelicolae valeant;

sentences.l:
A gate facing them, huge, and of solid adamant columns,
so that force none of men, not themselves to root it out in war
the heaven-dwellers could;

sentences.t:
lucent genialibus altis
aurea fulcra toris, epulaeque ante ora paratae
regifico luxu;

sentences.l:
gleam on festal high
golden supports on couches, and feasts before their faces prepared
with kingly luxury;
